  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 32054,
  "published": "2026-08-19T07:59:33.79Z",
  "readmeFile": "Package.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added GifDecoder, decoding GIF87a/GIF89a image data to RGBA8 pixels: LZW\ndecompression, global and local color tables, and interlaced or non-interlaced data. Two deliberate\nlimits, both matching PowerPoint's own still-export rendering: only the first image frame is decoded\n(no animation or interframe disposal), and the Graphic Control Extension's transparent-color-index\nflag is parsed but not honored - every decoded pixel is fully opaque, with a transparent-flagged\nindex rendered as its literal color table entry.",
